  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"16a\"><p><strong>16a</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>The air molecule is to the left of its equilibrium position, it is moving to the left and its acceleration is pointing to the right. </p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"16b\"><p><strong>16b</strong></p><p></p>\n<p>Speed is maximum when displacement is zero.</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v = (2 \\pi)(210) \\sqrt{(4.7 \\times 10^{-9})^{2} - 0^{2}} \\approx 6.2 \\times 10^{-6}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"16c\"><p><strong>16c</strong></p><p></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a = \\left ( 2 \\pi \\times 210 \\right )^{2} \\times (4.7 \\times 10^{-9}) \\approx 8.2 \\times 10^{-3}\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span></p>\n<p></p></section>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows the displacement of a standing sound wave in a pipe at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span>. Point P is the equilibrium position of an air molecule in the wave.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>a. Describe the motion of this air molecule at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{3T}{8}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>   [3]</p>\n<p>The amplitude of the air molecule's oscillations is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.7\"></span> nm. The frequency of the wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"210\"></span> Hz.</p>\n<p>b. Find the maximum speed of the air molecule.</p>\n<p>    [2]</p>\n<p>c. Determine the maximum acceleration of the air molecule.</p>\n<p>   [1]</p>"
  },
